        "runId": "ada-en-63081f33d4c840e99362579a12d8b39a",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "Acapulco"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:b9ad3e14216c2f08",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "7d938e02328a74d62e29fbbcdc0b1b032f842825d51d96026af7e679135dc6a1",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-63081f33d4c840e99362579a12d8b39a",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      },
      "text": "After breakfast, set out on a half-day sightseeing tour of Acapulco.\n\nMountains surround the city, and its viewpoints look out over the bay and the Pacific Ocean. You’ll visit the historic Fort of San Diego, a Spanish colonial landmark with a museum exhibition.\n\nAnother stop is La Quebrada, where cliff divers leap into the sea from heights of up to 35 metres, or about 115 feet.\n\nAfter the tour, you’re free to stay in the resort area, head back to the bay or spend the rest of the day by the sea. The half-day tour leaves the afternoon open, and the following day is entirely at leisure."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_label:0b884f5477963a30",
